msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Multiplication table"
msgstr "Táboa de multiplicar"

#: ../src/activities/algebra_by/ActivityInfo.qml:14
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid ""
"A multiplication of two numbers is displayed. At the right of the equals "
"sign, give the answer, the product. Use the left and right arrows to modify "
"your answer and press the Enter key to check if you've got it right. If not, "
"just try again."
msgstr ""
"Móstrase a multiplicación de dous números. Á dereita do signo igual pon a "
"túa resposta: o produto deses números. Usa as frechas 'esquerda' e 'dereita' "
"para modificar a túa resposta e preme a tecla Intro para ver se respondiches "
"correctamente. Se non acertaches podes tentalo de novo."

#: ../src/activities/ballcatch/ActivityInfo.qml:28
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Make the ball go to Tux"
msgstr "Fai que a bóla lle chegue a Tux"

#: ../src/activities/ballcatch/ActivityInfo.qml:29
#: ../src/activities/ballcatch/ActivityInfo.qml:33
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid ""
"Press the two shift keys at the same time, to make the ball go in a straight "
"line."
msgstr ""
"Preme as dúas teclas de maiúsculas ao mesmo tempo para que a bóla vaia en "
"liña recta."

#: ../src/activities/algebra_minus/ActivityInfo.qml:9
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
